# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: SiblingHintHonestSplitHintOwnUnapplied
TARGET: SiblingHintHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the split hands the heads before the donor's own appends below them are applied
PERTURBS: SplitCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitHint = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
    /\ \A o \in Offs : o < sh[a] /\ author[o] = a => o \in cache[a]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no drain of own appends below the heads.
--- END
